<title>USA: U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</title>
<headline>U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of total U.S. mortgage applications rose 9.2 percent in the week ended August 30, according to a Mortgage Bankers Association of America weekly survey.</p>
<p>The volume of applications to refinance mortgages rose 7.9 percent in the latest survey week, while applications to purchase mortgages rose 9.5 percent.</p>
<p>The seasonally adjusted refinancing index rose 7.9 percent to 283.6 from 262.9 the previous week, it said.</p>
<p>The purchase index rose 12.0 percent to 193.5 in the latest survey from 172.8 in the previous week, it said.  </p>
